    "notes": [
      [
        18,
        175,
        "DNP header allows power/radio bring-up with an external 3.3 V MCU. Final onboard MCU is not captured yet.\nPin 1 = 3V3, pin 2 = GND; all IO must be 3.3 V. Never apply 5 V to any pin.\nSora: pin 1 is an OUTPUT; do not drive 3V3 from the external host while the battery rail is powered.\nHashi: pin 1 is an INPUT; external regulated 3.3 V supply must allocate >= 200 mA for radio.\nHost supplies SPI SCK/MOSI/NSS, NRST and RXEN; reads MISO/BUSY/DIO1.\nOptional Sora pins 11/12 are I2C SCL/SDA; pins 13/14 read CHG_STAT1/2.\nHeaders are explicitly DNP and can be removed when the actual MCU sheets replace this boundary."
      ]
    ]
